 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the angle ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["arctan",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
